; draw_tui.glyph — the text-UI look: Unicode strings become VGA (CP437)
; characters, lines and boxes join, a panel inside a panel is a group, and
; NUMBER turns field text into a number.
SCREEN 44 14
SET total 0
PANEL w 0 0 44 14 "Tools ♦ test"
PANEL g 2 2 20 6 "Group"
BOX 24 2 9 5
BOX 32 2 9 5
LINE 24 4 40 4
LABEL l 4 3 "♥ café ±5° ½"
LABEL s 4 4 "░▒▓█ ▀▄▌▐ ☺►"
FIELD n 4 6 8 add2
BUTTON b 24 9 "Go" add2
LABEL t 24 11 :total
TEXT 3 9 "no glyph: 😀"
ON add2 [IF NUMBERP :n [SET total (NUMBER :n) * 2]]
